{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"还说不清\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里既不安，又有股不肯停的劲；身体先绷紧，脑子没跟上，连在等什么、舍不得什么都说不清。\",\n      \"key\": \"不肯停的劲\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他硬撑着不让自己垮下去，心里也想停一停；真投进去，他又怕会失去别的东西。\",\n      \"key\": \"硬撑着\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B5\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"text\": \"熟悉的感觉一回来，身体先有了往前的冲动；可过去回不来，他还不知道该往哪走。\",\n      \"key\": \"身体先有了往前的冲动\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B4\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他想弄清这一步值不值得冒险，可刚有把握，舍不得又回来，他又不敢信刚才的判断，为非得想透才肯动而难堪。\",\n      \"key\": \"非得想透才肯动\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R1\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-1\", \"S01-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"拆分补足\",\n      \"why\": \"保留说不清所等、心里有股劲的状态；补出身体先反应而念头未跟上的过程，解释恍惚与无名失落。另补熟悉感唤起向前冲动、过去却无法回来，覆盖段内变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R2\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留硬撑、想停、害怕投入后失去东西这三层相连的心理事实。删去没有前史支撑的把事情照旧等同于认可现状的判断，改为人物实际感受到的进退冲突。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R3\", \"R4\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S01-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把寻找理由和不舍反复打断确信合成一个求证循环。将理由具体落在这一步是否值得冒险，保留刚有把握又不敢相信自己、为非得想透才肯行动而难堪的心理。用具体的判断动摇替代抽象的确信变陌生，也不再无依据地概括为每次。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"熟悉感具体从何而来，没有前史可以确定。不能把珠子里的旧场景补成真实往事，只能保留它唤起的向前冲动，以及熟悉感不能让过去回来的限制。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "42b7d36b-adc9-4601-8640-15909620c91f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T011557369456Z", "elapsed_seconds": 168.422, "completed_utc": "2026-10-30T01:18:45.801814+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "100ef75cef8be12a197222ba9efaa1a2e05e344cf6d58f1fc92b824cbe3528bd", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261030T011557369456Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "e65c9e6d10b450d219293a475fb6cb5d32980995a2cf8e220f5e503cdd7013e8"}}}
